&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0IkOOBV4KNAMj4BSSxR7WPe98_c9xHnJ98QryksBqUCA&oe=69E8C537"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1014885264124822", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819375_1014885267458155_4732627606674535666_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KbWczSqdzKcQ7kNvwGFY3_N&_nc_oc=Adpv-udIl6w_m6Tash6tuwW7y_OzwGDmMh3D8W8xZCh4XBZc-_A3JMlzkphq1G9UMxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1NwLce7vaLYLvQFBTi1BPkP3Cw3e0DG0FoyfNhSVhA-g&oe=69E8AEE5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "592606743148111", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391923_592606746481444_8966562253819213417_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KptMsWMecFQQ7kNvwFkZZBn&_nc_oc=AdqmUX46OnOF5w8Gt-ksz-2f4VVYRb5lRvhX1mVMPi61nCFJvMCW6JPaAv0-cCS-Mi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0U5Lo-Qoqf-M9mMYBrnL9dE-fccLP89tUPA5TiD3gQ6Q&oe=69E8BA15"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "3508709025927990", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391985_3508709029261323_3016583868344724243_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FIiBNYPnL7kQ7kNvwGUKCHd&_nc_oc=AdpHtf4j977TV_5CrJQ66uul0j1nboWUwcjJlE5fcBxmqQgBgDiy6l62Gf5G2V4Ogj4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1BP3nTyjS9muvDuMob4fzSWyQzrLzuT9DTWzpjrK5idw&oe=69E8C427"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1333140684643275", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391976_1333140687976608_7978945902575114739_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SAsFVySYek4Q7kNvwHLAR6T&_nc_oc=AdrA7x_L_SYeNFOFFdg-M9-pdA3eVk7ULORNvN322Fhe2OjdIPTHokiSH2so7CQdD4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af28_3rfb07YHuNQF61gvMScMdBna0Kc5DVs6KSkYRjBmw&oe=69E8C890"}, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Free Style Boxing", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# Catch the Rhythm, Punch Your Way to Fit in VR!\n\nTired of boring workouts? Ready to **truly enjoy** getting fit? Welcome to **Fit Beat Combat Boxing**! Experience an exhilarating **VR fitness game** on Meta Quest where rhythm meets power! This isn't just another game \u2013 it's your personal boxing ring, high-energy dance floor, and path to a healthier, stronger you. An addictive **VR workout** challenge!\n\n# Feel the Beat, Land the Punch!\n\nDynamic VR arenas meet heart-pumping music. Simple controls: put on your Quest headset (2, 3, or Pro) & move! Notes sync to infectious beats. Unleash your inner champion! **Jab, cross, hook, and uppercut** notes with precision. **Duck and weave** past obstacles, keeping your body moving and heart rate soaring. Intuitive, exhilarating, fun **full-body workout** to make you sweat! Perfect for cardio and calorie burning!\n\n# Your Personal Coach Awaits!\n\nYou're not alone. Our expert **virtual instructor** guides form, pushes you, & cheers you on. Learn technique and feel the burn. Adapts for **beginners** to **fitness pros** to keep you motivated.\n\n# Workout Your Way!\n\nDitch boring apps & gyms! **Fit Beat Combat Boxing** is your fun, effective fitness routine. Smash beats to reach goals like **weight loss**, boosting **stamina**, improving **coordination**, or **stress relief**!\n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Rhythm Boxing Gameplay:** Punch, duck, dodge to music! Music & exercise.\n- **Full-Body Workout:** Arms, core, legs workout for max calorie burn.\n- **Engaging Soundtrack:** Energizing music keeps you moving.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Rhythm Boxing Fitness! Get fit having fun with music & coaching! Thrilling full-body workout on Meta Quest. Quit boring exercises & achieve your ideal body!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story 